{
    "word": "ululation",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "db006e2b-6e95-3df0-aac9-2da981ff5bc6",
                "word": "ululation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bd4da8e8-4564-4807-a04c-7eaf5608d055",
                        "entry_id": "db006e2b-6e95-3df0-aac9-2da981ff5bc6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ululations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                        "entry_id": "db006e2b-6e95-3df0-aac9-2da981ff5bc6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of ululating; a long, loud, wavering cry or howl."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e533a1fb-9581-40f2-a154-52f47b61b6c9",
                                "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                                "text": "[T]he sound of the ululation brought my own past and future, my entire life, in front of my eyes like a very long road, and it was as if this ululation was reaching the ear from its most distant and shadowy edges. This is how my day began."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67f9dddb-5e3a-42ca-b6bb-89fa80f7c442",
                                "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                                "text": "The overthrown Martian set up a prolonged ululation, and immediately a second glittering giant, answering him, appeared over the trees[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbab39dd-3289-4880-a512-94ecc9958b7f",
                                "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                                "text": "As we started there broke from the thick silent woods behind us a sudden great ululation of the ape-men, which may have been a cheer of triumph at our departure or a jeer of contempt at our flight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91a448f3-0580-42f9-adf4-fa125d131668",
                                "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                                "text": "Because it is not as reliable as the simple ululation or the louder cross-register ululation, it should be allowed a certain amount of preparation time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a34bd8f-d857-4070-b8cd-21638cd62211",
                                "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                                "text": "Maryam, my research assistant, and I were going through some interviews we had conducted the previous day, when cheerful ululation disrupted our discussion. Coming from the culture of north Sudan, where such ululation may announce the happy news of a wedding or a circumcision, I assumed a similar situation was taking place […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f56e98a2-f6b4-4eff-86a2-ea9d5aa1e2d5",
                                "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                                "text": "The Queen had heard ululation many times in the past as she travelled the world, particularly in Africa, but this time, the sound made her shiver. Ululation is found in some singing techniques and ritual situations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d147d067-473a-4d4b-97d6-2f8835c67aba",
                                "sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                                "text": "As ululations and celebratory gunfire filled the air, the mood was one of fragile joy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ec46fdc4-074f-4f80-93f7-2bc4a18697dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "db006e2b-6e95-3df0-aac9-2da981ff5bc6",
                        "source_sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
                        "source_sense_description": "long, loud cry or howl",
                        "target_lang_word": "you-you",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "you-you",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88af055d-b984-3424-867d-354579538ffc",
                                        "entry_id": "f27e7ed4-99a4-3b3a-8fc8-07ebe4367901",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit canot court et large utilisé pour la navette entre les bateaux au mouillage et les quais."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf3e096a-9e1d-4447-a55b-4a7d991fbb42",
                                                "sense_id": "88af055d-b984-3424-867d-354579538ffc",
                                                "text": "Ayant visité le Cap Stewart, puis le Cap Hope, Mikkelsen, prévoyant le mauvais temps, était parti dans le you-you pour nous rejoindre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e47f07d-7de1-4283-82cb-e25697dd463e",
                                                "sense_id": "88af055d-b984-3424-867d-354579538ffc",
                                                "text": "Faisant honneur à son totem, Chat se glisse silencieusement jusqu’à un you-you…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7408b476-3eff-3eab-9668-a583c2b23373",
                                        "entry_id": "f27e7ed4-99a4-3b3a-8fc8-07ebe4367901",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cri de joie aigu modulé poussé en certaines occasions par les femmes d'Afrique du Nord."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Souvent au pluriel"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f264a94-71c3-48b9-b393-3259162dab31",
                                                "sense_id": "7408b476-3eff-3eab-9668-a583c2b23373",
                                                "text": "Sa mère accourt et lui ouvre. — Sa sœur s’accroche à lui ; toutes deux poussent des you-you de joie, le font entrer dans la chambre de la mère. La sœur court chez l’oncle et dit: « Voici ! Mon frère chéri est arrivé ». — On se lève et on vient en courant ainsi jusqu’à la maison. De nouveaux you-you sont poussés par les femmes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80d88f38-4bde-435b-b38a-d1077a4be7a5",
                                                "sense_id": "7408b476-3eff-3eab-9668-a583c2b23373",
                                                "text": "En aval de la mosquée, un troupeau de prostituées, commandées de service par le pacha, nous salua de grêles you-yous destinés à nous donner l’illusion d’une manifestation spontanée des femmes de Fez."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0055e78f-c1c0-497b-9e1e-c1eb6578dc5e",
                                                "sense_id": "7408b476-3eff-3eab-9668-a583c2b23373",
                                                "text": "Elle ne trouve pas les mots pour dire sa joie et lance un you-you strident que j’ai rarement entendu dans ma vie. La belle-mère, une amie et une cousine étant présentes, le you-you de Maïa est suivi par les autres."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9de7ba33-5478-4bae-8f83-235c0d0b530b",
                        "source_entry_id": "db006e2b-6e95-3df0-aac9-2da981ff5bc6",
                        "source_sense_id": "b40ca421-d718-36d1-a953-a7ae22dcf715",
